      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Executes scans, joins, filters, aggregations, sorts\nfor scan operators, requests required columns / row groups\ndata access path\n  1. Try memory cache\n  2.  If not present, try local SSD cache\n  3. If not present, read from OneLake / Delta\n  4.  Process data in memory\n  5. repeat throughout the query",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Executes scans, joins, filters, aggregations, sorts\nfor scan operators, requests required columns / row groups\ndata access path\n  1. Try memory cache\n  2.  If not present, try local SSD cache\n  3. If not present, read from OneLake / Delta\n  4.  Process data in memory\n  5. repeat throughout the query",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
